minios-thunar-integration (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Reuse minios-gui command progress, error, file chooser, and MiniOS CSS
    helpers for consistent module operation dialogs.
  * Keep conversion cancellation and NDJSON phase handling while bounding
    captured command output and reporting completion through the shared UI.
  * Require python3-minios-gui 1.4.0 at build and runtime.

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 03:09:59 +0300

minios-thunar-integration (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package for MiniOS Thunar integration
  * Add localized, idempotent MiniOS custom-action synchronization without
    replacing user-owned Thunar actions or wrapping the system Thunar binary
  * Add GTK create/extract progress and error dialogs backed by dir2sb/sb2dir
  * Delegate AUFS activation and deactivation exclusively to minios-tools sb
  * Support Thunar 1.6 from Ubuntu 18.04 through current Thunar releases
  * Use wide indeterminate progress bars with live phase text instead of small
    spinners or misleading synthetic percentages

 -- crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>  Sat, 05 Sep 2026 03:43:56 +0300
